 <!-- ========== CAREERS ========== -->
 <section class="section bg-sand-dark" id="careers">
 <div class="container">
 <div class="section-header fade-in">
 <h2>

 Impact Careers
 </h2>
 <p>

 Your career is ~80,000 working hours. It's your most valuable resource for positive impact in the world.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div class="res-grid--orgs fade-in">

 <a href="https://80000hours.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/80k-hours.png" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">80,000 Hours</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 The leading organization for evidence-based career guidance. Offers detailed guides, priority problem profiles, career reviews, and personalized advice to help you find a career that maximizes your positive impact.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 <a href="https://80000hours.org/career-guide/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/80k-hours.png" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">

 Complete Career Guide
 </div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 A step-by-step guide for choosing a high-impact career. Covers how to compare options, which skills to develop, and how to plan your career path. Available as a free online book.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 <a href="https://80000hours.org/job-board/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/80k-hours.png" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">80,000 Hours Job Board</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 The largest job board in the EA ecosystem. Hundreds of job listings at high-impact organizations in areas like AI, biosecurity, public policy, research, and operations.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 <a href="https://animaladvocacycareers.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/animal-advocacy.png" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">Animal Advocacy Careers</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 Specialized resources for animal welfare careers. Offers a job board, skills guides, and career advice for those who want to work at the most effective animal protection organizations in the world.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 </div>
 </div>
 </section>

 <!-- ========== EFFECTIVE GIVING ========== -->
 <section class="section bg-paper" id="giving">
 <div class="container">
 <div class="section-header fade-in">
 <h2>

 Effective Giving
 </h2>
 <p>

 The best charities are up to 100x more effective than average. These evaluators and platforms help you give where it matters most.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div class="res-grid--orgs fade-in">

 <a href="https://ayudaefectiva.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/ayuda-efectiva.png" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">Ayuda Efectiva</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 Spanish foundation that facilitates donations to the world's most effective organizations. Offers tax deductions in Spain and is the reference point for effective giving in the Spanish-speaking world.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 <a href="https://www.givewell.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/givewell.jpg" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">GiveWell</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 The most rigorous evaluator of global health and development interventions. Their recommended organizations save lives for as little as $3,000-$5,000 per life. Publishes complete cost-effectiveness analyses for each intervention.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 <a href="https://www.givingwhatwecan.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/gwwc.png" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">Giving What We Can</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 Global community of over 9,000 people who have pledged to donate at least 10% of their income to the most effective organizations. Offers an impact calculator, giving guides, and a platform to manage your pledge.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 <a href="https://animalcharityevaluators.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/ace.png" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">Animal Charity Evaluators</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 Leading evaluator of animal welfare organizations. Publishes annual evidence-based recommendations on which organizations achieve the greatest impact for animals per dollar donated.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 <a href="https://funds.effectivealtruism.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/ea-funds.jpg" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">EA Funds</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 Platform to donate to expert-managed funds in four cause areas: global health, animal welfare, long-term future, and EA infrastructure. Fund managers distribute donations to the highest-impact opportunities in each area.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 </div>
 </div>
 </section>

 <!-- ========== FUNDING ========== -->
 <section class="section bg-sand-dark" id="funding">
 <div class="container">
 <div class="section-header fade-in">
 <h2>

 Project Funding
 </h2>
 <p>

 The EA ecosystem has funds and grant programs to finance projects, research, and organizations aligned with effective altruism.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div class="res-grid--orgs fade-in">

 <a href="https://funds.effectivealtruism.org/apply-for-funding" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/ea-funds.jpg" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">EA Funds</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 The primary funding source for EA projects. Offers $1K to $500K grants across four funds: global health, animal welfare, long-term future, and EA infrastructure. Applications take less than 1 hour and are reviewed by expert fund managers.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 <a href="https://coefficientgiving.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/coeff-logo.png" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">Coefficient Giving</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 Formerly Open Philanthropy. One of the world's largest philanthropic funders, with over $5B granted since 2014. Funds research and projects in 13 areas including AI, biosecurity, animal welfare, and global health.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 <a href="https://survivalandflourishing.fund/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/sff-logo.svg" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">Survival and Flourishing Fund</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 Fund focused on the long-term survival and flourishing of life. Has coordinated over $150M in donations through its algorithmic process (S-Process). Funds AI safety, biosecurity, and institutional resilience.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 <a href="https://futureoflife.org/grants/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/fli-logo2.png" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">Future of Life Institute</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 Awards grants for existential risk research, including a $25M AI safety program. Also funds policy, advocacy, and behavioral science projects related to transformative technologies.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 <a href="https://www.charityentrepreneurship.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/ce-logo.png" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">Charity Entrepreneurship</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 High-impact organization incubator. Offers an intensive program with seed funding, mentorship, and operational support to found new NGOs in the highest-impact areas identified by their research.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 <a href="https://www.mercatus.org/emergent-ventures" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="res-card res-card--org">
 <img src="/img/resources/ev-logo.png" alt="" class="res-logo">
 <div class="res-body">
 <div class="res-title">Emergent Ventures</div>
 <div class="res-desc">

 Fast and flexible grant program from the Mercatus Center. Funds ambitious ideas and talented people with potential to improve the future, without the bureaucratic constraints typical of traditional foundations.
 </div>
 </div>
 </a>

 </div>
 </div>
 </section>

